<title>DENMARK: SBAB raises 4% pct 2003 bond to 700 mln DKK.</title>
<headline>SBAB raises 4% pct 2003 bond to 700 mln DKK.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's state-owned mortgage lender  SBAB is raising an existing four percent bond due 2003 by 200 million  Danish crowns to 700 million crowns, arranger Den Danske Bank said  in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange on Friday.</p>
<p>Den Danske Bank said that it took all the bonds for resale.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969652</p>
</text>
